From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gregory Mitchell <me@gmitch215.xyz>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wasm: build control groups with the cgroup2 filesystem

systemd as PID 1 mounts cgroup2 on /sys/fs/cgroup and stops when the
mount fails. CGROUPS builds kernel/cgroup (cgroup2, cgroup.procs,
cgroup.controllers, cgroup.kill, cgroup.freeze) and nothing else; no
controller is enabled.
---
 arch/wasm/configs/wasm32_nommu_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/wasm/configs/wasm32_nommu_defconfig b/arch/wasm/configs/wasm32_nommu_defconfig
--- a/arch/wasm/configs/wasm32_nommu_defconfig
+++ b/arch/wasm/configs/wasm32_nommu_defconfig
@@ -53,3 +53,4 @@ CONFIG_EPOLL=y
 CONFIG_FUTEX=y
 CONFIG_MULTIUSER=y
 CONFIG_POSIX_TIMERS=y
+CONFIG_CGROUPS=y
--
2.43.0

